:question/id #uuid "addfb264-5013-5ace-a74a-d9286a8c951b" :question/math-academy-id "q-126351" :question/problem "Which of the following matrices are lower triangular matrices?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n$A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "The matrices $A$ and $B$ are lower triangular matrices since all the entries above the main diagonal are zeros.\n\nThe matrix $C$ is *not* a lower triangular matrix since it has a non-zero element above the main diagonal: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{c}_{12} & =-2\\ne 0\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id 17592186262605 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id 17592186119772 :knowledge-point/title "Identifying a Triangular Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "37c4a7a7-6201-5e3d-b83c-54214a0f73f1" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "D=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186260369} {:answer/id #uuid "5cc900a1-3450-5e9d-9935-fbf3414db9ed" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "C=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 \\\\ 5 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186260670} {:answer/id #uuid "89212b5f-4485-5c4a-b4e2-c1ef65585d7b" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "B=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186261068} {:answer/id #uuid "bebca5d9-6d1a-5817-b8da-7eabbdef4d81" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "A=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186261559} {:answer/id #uuid "ffcb6a99-0bd4-51ca-8095-57e4548dde55" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "E=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186262118}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "37c4a7a7-6201-5e3d-b83c-54214a0f73f1" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "D=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186260369} :answer-field/id #uuid "58d1ccae-7378-52fd-94ac-13da15be20dc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186262276}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "e2e910d3-5a56-5ffe-990b-2c75157e1876" :question/math-academy-id "q-126352" :question/problem "Which of the following is an upper triangular matrix?" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $D$ is a matrix for which all entries *below* the diagonal are $0$'s:\n\n$$\nD=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nHence, it is an upper triangular matrix. \n\nBy contrast, matrices $A$, $B$, $C$, and $E$ each have at least one non-zero entry below the diagonal:\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 \\\\ 5 & 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,E=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nSo, they are not upper triangular matrices."}] [{:db/id 17592186262606 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id 17592186119772 :knowledge-point/title "Identifying a Triangular Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "444210f3-62f9-5a79-983b-cb130e47cdf7" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "C=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 7 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186260470} {:answer/id #uuid "6651e89b-870d-5413-8f00-8d96b56e49c2" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "B=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186260766} {:answer/id #uuid "844897da-9608-5dd5-98e7-d4da1a4ec155" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "D=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186261025} {:answer/id #uuid "9a74db97-2782-5e50-9e12-0c4456b66a87" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "E=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186261215} {:answer/id #uuid "9f58f91c-fe9e-5c7f-8841-fec1c4d68389" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "A=\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186261257}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9a74db97-2782-5e50-9e12-0c4456b66a87" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "E=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186261215} :answer-field/id #uuid "3437cc72-e427-5ac7-afd8-fe2d376e33a5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186262218}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "8edd360b-8c0f-5c8f-b5f1-4655b27f3fa4" :question/math-academy-id "q-126354" :question/problem "Which of the following is an upper triangular matrix?" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $E$ is a matrix for which all entries *below* the diagonal are $0$'s:\n\n$$\nE=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nHence, it is an upper triangular matrix. \n\nBy contrast, matrices $A$, $B$, $C$, and $D$ each have at least one non-zero entry below the diagonal:\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 7 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,D=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nSo, they are not upper triangular matrices."}] [{:db/id 17592186262616 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id 17592186119784 :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Correct Statements About a Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "12919bee-30a9-5706-b50b-8d68bb9ec18f" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186437740} {:answer/id #uuid "bf178365-d264-5e92-b9fa-13b65028e647" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186437741}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bf178365-d264-5e92-b9fa-13b65028e647" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186437741} :answer-field/id #uuid "4fea4c98-9183-5469-a75e-5f3f42402c15" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186438899} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9c11d7ef-9785-5af7-9c0c-e9bd1c6a90b6" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186437742} {:answer/id #uuid "9223ddb4-98d2-5931-a218-a09a74ddf7ab" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186437743}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9c11d7ef-9785-5af7-9c0c-e9bd1c6a90b6" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186437742} :answer-field/id #uuid "d0b3decd-5ac4-5039-a12b-8665619852b6" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186438900} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a52ffa70-0c3f-53a1-ac44-7af5faba118b" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186437744} {:answer/id #uuid "cc394039-cc55-5bf1-8409-56c46c0c7d51" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186437745}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a52ffa70-0c3f-53a1-ac44-7af5faba118b" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186437744} :answer-field/id #uuid "ecc05fd9-552e-52c7-aa2c-c25a1903c6fd" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186438901}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "d3df39a1-3dce-5051-9bb1-2a36ee3c62ca" :question/math-academy-id "q-126477" :question/problem "Consider the matrix \n$B=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.$\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $B$ is upper triangular\n- **II.** $B$ is lower triangular\n- **III.** $B-{B}^{T}$ is upper triangular" :question/worked-solution "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true, since all the entries below the main diagonal equal to zero:\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is false, since $A$ has non-zero entries above the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is false, since the result of $B-{B}^{T}$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nB-{B}^{T}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -5 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only\"."}] [{:db/id 17592186262617 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id 17592186119784 :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Correct Statements About a Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "eb56e3e4-d13e-506f-b457-467943ab9482" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186437746} {:answer/id #uuid "86262feb-536d-5ef8-afcc-c7b14bc45026" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186437747}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "86262feb-536d-5ef8-afcc-c7b14bc45026" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186437747} :answer-field/id #uuid "1080d492-9821-5364-8530-4c7dbd0bd3c0" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186438902} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0a0f61d8-2bc9-5ba5-8d56-d3b975c8bf07" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186437748} {:answer/id #uuid "0e783ddd-e977-54e7-8580-da07e92b8e98" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186437749}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0e783ddd-e977-54e7-8580-da07e92b8e98" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186437749} :answer-field/id #uuid "771187b2-e28f-5a7d-a91d-34f73489e1ad" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186438903} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "520ef5db-e43e-5e23-92a0-3ed7c62386b8" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186437750} {:answer/id #uuid "6e998b87-0e1c-59a3-830c-e099cf52d227" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186437751}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6e998b87-0e1c-59a3-830c-e099cf52d227" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186437751} :answer-field/id #uuid "c1bcc754-87e4-5cec-9f4e-5a5e7e36cb54" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186438904}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "f41ff7d0-b754-5033-a620-53eef8a376e3" :question/math-academy-id "q-126479" :question/problem "Consider the matrix \n$C=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -5\\end{bmatrix}.$\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $C$ is upper triangular\n- **II.** $C$ is lower triangular\n- **III.** ${C}^{T}$ is upper triangular" :question/worked-solution "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true. All the entries below the main diagonal of $C$ are zeros:\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is true. All the entries above the main diagonal of $C$ are zeros:\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is true. All the entries below the main diagonal of ${C}^{T}$ are zeros:\n\n$$\n{C}^{T}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III\"."}] [{:db/id 17592186262618 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id 17592186119784 :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Correct Statements About a Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0fbb2fac-47b6-5bca-8490-fe78f86c36be" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186437752} {:answer/id #uuid "a79d2921-bc2e-5736-ba05-a01f24841be1" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186437753}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0fbb2fac-47b6-5bca-8490-fe78f86c36be" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186437752} :answer-field/id #uuid "5f459b66-0738-5236-8dd3-52a31064b6f5" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186438905} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "604f880c-2e1e-517e-a3c7-ef164e3b3d96" 