ion/worked-solution "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true, since all the entries above the main diagonal are zeros:\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is false, since the result of ${A}^{T}-A$ has non-zero entries above the main diagonal:\n\n$$\n{A}^{T}-A=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is false, since $A$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only\"."}] [{:db/id 17592186335965 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id 17592186119771 :knowledge-point/title "Describing a Triangular Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0ebdc373-e824-544e-a663-3e81e198ab3c" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Identity matrix" :db/id 17592186333120} {:answer/id #uuid "468ff85f-9edf-5fe6-9793-87770bd67696" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Upper triangular matrix" :db/id 17592186333643} {:answer/id #uuid "47797f78-44ae-5bc7-b946-02473dcbf35e" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Other" :db/id 17592186333649} {:answer/id #uuid "5b8882c3-c96e-5930-aa23-7d4cdec4480a" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Diagonal matrix" :db/id 17592186333824} {:answer/id #uuid "95e8e6ba-141a-53ae-956a-2f81b70a2289" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Lower triangular matrix" :db/id 17592186334324}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5b8882c3-c96e-5930-aa23-7d4cdec4480a" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Diagonal matrix" :db/id 17592186333824} :answer-field/id #uuid "ea3f64fe-e984-5262-92ac-fcc2da91a4b7" :answer-field/key "s