estion/worked-solution "The matrix $A$ is an upper triangular matrix since all the entries below the main diagonal are zeros.\n\nThe matrices $B$ and $C$ are *not* upper triangular matrices since they each have a non-zero element below the main diagonal: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{b}_{31} & =10\\ne 0 \\\\ {c}_{32} & =7\\ne 0\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id 17592186487471 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id 17592186119771 :knowledge-point/title "Describing a Triangular Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1a2f0c46-e97b-53b6-a015-183acc361df6" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Other" :db/id 17592186487470} {:answer/id #uuid "6d44da1f-50cd-56da-9f2f-b3098354804a" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Identity matrix" :db/id 17592186487473} {:answer/id #uuid "9515e58c-fb54-5830-aad1-a53c0a98f246" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Lower triangular matrix" :db/id 17592186487476} {:answer/id #uuid "9b803411-0462-5014-a05a-f195cdddeb78" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Upper triangular matrix" :db/id 17592186487478} {:answer/id #uuid "ee799a5b-a657-5f4d-960e-aad976dc3a9e" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Diagonal matrix" :db/id 17592186487482}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ee799a5b-a657-5f4d-960e-aad976dc3a9e" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Diagonal matrix" :db/id 17592186487482} :answer-field/id #uuid "865489ed-d12a-50e6-97a3-0f715a2a0751" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186487474}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "25b4a25d-b604-50d3-a613-7e42cd7fe17c" :question/problem "How can we best describe the following matrix? \n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $A$ is a matrix for which all entries above and below the diagonal are $0$'s:\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, it is a diagonal matrix."}] [{:db/id 17592186488404 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id 17592186119784 :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Correct Statements About a Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "539855fa-6c5d-53c2-8e6b-3ae037750849" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186488400} {:answer/id #uuid "88990fe2-e5bf-51c0-a552-f3a9611b1ebd" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186488401}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "539855fa-6c5d-53c2-8e6b-3ae037750849" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186488400} :answer-field/id #uuid "1f123478-0b1d-5380-b456-3eb2029b111c" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186488396} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1094c3c3-975f-530e-bff0-7807d9d9ab97" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186488395} {:answer/id #uuid "334bed91-dadd-511d-a2e8-3228c1bd2233" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186488397}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1094c3c3-975f-530e-bff0-7807d9d9ab97" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186488395} :answer-field/id #uuid "8f11f16f-2bde-5b13-90cc-e018dd7a5dfc" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186488402} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "35c1b49e-afb2-5995-9b1c-7a650c3923c6" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186488398} {:answer/id #uuid "52d664dd-84d9-50fd-8032-ee9ee3585001" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186488399}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "52d664dd-84d9-50fd-8032-ee9ee3585001" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186488399} :answer-field/id #uuid "a54ab5f5-3aa4-5cb2-a67f-b05de4913639" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186488403}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "ac6bf26c-daf9-5149-b82c-ecff54a2e1d7" :question/problem "Consider the matrix \n$B=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 6 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -7 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix}.$\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $B$ is upper triangular\n- **II.** $B$ is lower triangular\n- **III.** $B-{B}^{T}$ is upper triangular" :question/worked-solution "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true, since all the entries below the main diagonal equal to zero:\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 6 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -7 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is false, since $B$ has non-zero entries above the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 6 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -7 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is false, since the result of $B-{B}^{T}$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nB-{B}^{T}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 6 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -6 & 0 & -7 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 7 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -6 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only\"."}] [{:db/id 17592186571387 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id 17592186119772 :knowledg